This repository is private and is shared with invited collaborators for review.
Until a licence is added, all rights are reserved by the author.

Why: the Fortran code in simulations/Source/ was adapted from the Monte Carlo case study
that accompanies the book "Understanding Molecular Simulation" by Daan Frenkel and Berend Smit.
The licence of that code has to be checked before this repository can be made public
or given an open-source licence. See README.md, section "Credits and licence".
